        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Bisi bele bath combines basmati rice, "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "dal ",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "glossaryTooltip",
                "attrs": {
                  "termSlug": "dal"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": ", and vegetables in one pot. A finishing spoonful of "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "ghee",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "glossaryTooltip",
                "attrs": {
                  "termSlug": "ghee"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " and a hit of "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "tamarind",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "glossaryTooltip",
                "attrs": {
                  "termSlug": "tamarind"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " give it a distinct sweet-sour depth."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Cook the lentils until completely soft before adding the rice. This ensures everything comes together in one texture."
          }
        ]
